# 鏈結式的資料結構

*   資料放置在分散的記憶區, 但以Node參照鏈結資料
*   需要用到多少, 就產生多少個Node物件
*   `class Node { int entry; Node next; }`
*   `entry`資料及`next`參照

## 範例

```java
Node a = new Node(12), b = new Node(9), c = new Node(23), d = new Node(17);
```

串接:
```java
a.next = b;
b.next = c;
c.next = d;
```

`=運算`: 指向同一物件

```java
for(Node node = a; node != null; node = node.next)
    System.out.print(node)
```

